    <item>
        <title>Header-banner single-cell table at the top of an article is unwrapped</title>
        <link>https://news.uams.edu/sample-sct-a/</link>
        <content:encoded><![CDATA[<table>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td><p align="center"><strong><em>'American Health Care. If It's Broken, Fix It!'</em></strong></p></td></tr></tbody></table>

LITTLE ROCK – Thomas Boat, M.D., an advocate for improved pediatric subspecialty training, will present the lecture.
<p>The lecture, which is free and open to the public, will be held in the auditorium.</p>]]></content:encoded>
    </item>
